    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, Break eggs, add onion, green chilli, black pepper powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder, salt to taste.",
      "Whisk everything with a fork for a few seconds. Set aside.",
      "In a pan, heat oil and butter.",
      "Add in the omelette mixture to the pan. Swirl the pan so the omelette mixture evenly spreads and covers the width of the pan.",
      "Add two bread slices on top of the omelette.",
      "Immediately flip the bread. A little bit of the egg mixture would stick to the bread.",
      "Cook for 30 seconds on a medium flame. Now, flip the omelette along with the bread slices. Fold the omelette on the bread from all the sides.",
      "Now place cheese slices on any one bread slice and then place the other bread slice on it to make a sandwich.",
      "Cook the sides and serve hot."
    ],
